WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
Lord Sun, this country

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:02,560
There's something weird about this place

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,080
I can't dig it out at all.

4
00:00:13,950 --> 00:00:20,220
How could you use so much force?

5
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:21,460
Dig hard for me

6
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:22,820
Makikawa can dig it

7
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:24,580
Why can't you poach the adults?

8
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:26,020
The snow above is easy to dig

9
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:27,300
Dig down to the bottom layer of soil

10
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:28,780
It's like hitting an iron plate

11
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:30,020
Even if I knock it, it will break the roll.

12
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:31,340
The girl from the Yun family said clearly

13
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:32,780
There are only three people in Makikawa

14
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:34,380
You can dig down more than ten feet deep

15
00:00:34,380 --> 00:00:35,780
We are dozens of young and strong people

16
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:42,210
Why can't I dig it down even for a while? Stop digging and pass on my order.

17
00:00:42,210 --> 00:00:43,690
Build a temporary snow house first

18
00:00:43,690 --> 00:00:49,740
Let’s avoid the limelight, Brother Makikawa, they have so many people and so much strength.

19
00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:51,540
I really can't even dig an inch of soil.

20
00:00:51,540 --> 00:00:52,700
All we have to do is dig out the snow

21
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:53,820
Why is this?
